{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/120495","repository_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot","labels_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/120495/labels{/name}","comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/120495/comments","events_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/120495/events","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/120495","id":4707994717,"node_id":"PR_kwDOAO6SJc7ovdTo","number":120495,"title":"GraphEdit: Fix dragged connection preview thicker than settled connections","user":{"login":"reforia","id":11989463,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjExOTg5NDYz","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/11989463?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/reforia","html_url":"https://github.com/reforia","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/reforia/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/reforia/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/reforia/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/reforia/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/reforia/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/reforia/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/reforia/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/reforia/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/reforia/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"labels":[{"id":279096997,"node_id":"MDU6TGFiZWwyNzkwOTY5OTc=","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/labels/archived","name":"archived","color":"aaaaaa","default":false,"description":"","archived_at":null,"archived_by":null}],"state":"closed","locked":false,"assignees":[],"milestone":null,"comments":0,"created_at":"2026-06-20T18:49:03Z","updated_at":"2026-06-20T21:42:17Z","closed_at":"2026-06-20T18:57:54Z","assignee":null,"author_association":"NONE","issue_field_values":[],"type":null,"active_lock_reason":null,"draft":true,"pull_request":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/pulls/120495","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/120495","diff_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/120495.diff","patch_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/120495.patch","merged_at":null},"body":"The dragged connection line is created with `use_parent_material(true)`, so it ignores the per-line `ShaderMaterial` that `_update_top_connection_layer()` assigns it and renders against the parent material instead. The connection shader's rim/AA is then sized for the wrong width, so the drag preview draws visibly thicker than established connections.\n\nEstablished connection lines are created at runtime in `connect_node()` and keep their own material — only the constructor-built `dragged_connection_line` was swept into the recent change making internal children use their parent's material. Dropping `use_parent_material` on it restores its own correctly-configured material, matching connections.\n\nBefore/After screenshots to follow.\n","closed_by":{"login":"reforia","id":11989463,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjExOTg5NDYz","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/11989463?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/reforia","html_url":"https://github.com/reforia","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/reforia/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/reforia/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/reforia/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/reforia/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/reforia/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/reforia/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/reforia/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/reforia/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/reforia/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/120495/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"timeline_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/120495/timeline","performed_via_github_app":null,"state_reason":null}